 keycard sandbox   welcome


  Run an AI agent that never holds a secret.

  The agent runs in a local Kubernetes cluster. Every HTTPS request it makes
  goes through the egress proxy, which asks your Keycard zone for the user's
  credential and adds it on the way out.

